  "interpretation": "Contrasting gene and metabolite tissue allocation suggests modular expression across plant organs, but no evidence of maintenance of the full floral anthocyanin pathway or evolutionary re-expression. In particular, published DFR root:leaf contrasts are not comparisons against flower.",
